## Quick Reference

### Most Common Maintenance Tasks

```bash
# Daily health check
npx tsx scripts/validateCodebase.ts
npx tsx scripts/validateEmojiConsistency.ts

# Weekly memory cleanup
npx tsx scripts/memoryManager.ts maintain weekly

# Check scheduled jobs
launchctl list | grep superalignment

# Check monitoring
ps aux | grep channel-monitor

# Run diagnostics
npx tsx scripts/comprehensiveDiagnostic.ts > logs/diag_$(date +%Y%m%d).log 2>&1 &

# Validate specific system
npx tsx scripts/validateMortalityReporting.ts
```

### Emergency Procedures

**If validation fails:**
1. Check the specific error in logs
2. Run the specific validation script for details
3. Fix issues before committing
4. Re-run validation to confirm fix

**If scheduled jobs aren't running:**
```bash
# Check if jobs are loaded
launchctl list | grep superalignment

# Reload if needed
launchctl load ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.superalignment.research-questions.plist

# Check logs
tail -f logs/launchd-*.log
```

**If monitors aren't working:**
```bash
# Check if processes are running
ps aux | grep -E "channel-monitor|watch"

# Restart if needed
npx tsx scripts/channel-monitor.ts > logs/channel-monitor.log 2>&1 &
```

